    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Punish Evildoers at Any Cost</p></blockquote><p>The Oath of Vengeance is a solemn commitment to punish those who have committed grievous evil. When evil armies slaughter helpless villagers, when a tyrant defies the will of the gods, when a thieves' guild grows too violent, when a dragon ravages the countryside—at such times, Paladins arise and swear this oath to set right what has gone wrong.</p><p>These Paladins share the following tenets:</p><ul><li>Show the wicked no mercy.</li><li>Fight injustice and its causes.</li><li>Aid those harmed by injustice.</li></ul><h3>Oath of Vengeance Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.q1DPu4TPyESMCkOz]{Oath of Vengeance Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.d7QiCK7MzVU5A8OW]{Vow of Enmity}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.eCuUy2QRZ2HX4IB5]{Relentless Avenger}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7qOtmLmttRXGMcfT]{Soul of Vengeance}</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.peBwqzBqJDe5EZvP]{Avenging Angel}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Oath of Vengeance Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Paladin Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBane000000]{Bane}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHuntersMar]{Hunter's Mark}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHoldPerson]{Hold Person}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMistyStep0]{Misty Step}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHaste00000]{Haste}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbProtectionFro]{Protection from Energy}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBanishment]{Banishment}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDimensionD]{Dimension Door}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHoldMonste]{Hold Monster}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
